  "brief": { "zh": "在日食结束前让四台对手全部停机。观测窗每次开一侧、关另一侧，改变中央大厅的通道和脉冲视线。观测窗在第 9、18 和 27 回合结束时切换。两台追击机可以离开穹顶，两台守点机留守观测台。窗格上有机器人时那扇窗本次保持开启。", "en": "Tag out all four rivals before the eclipse ends. Rotating observation windows open on one side and close on the other, changing the paths and pulse lanes across the dome. Windows switch after turns 9, 18 and 27. Two hunters can leave the dome and two sentries hold the platforms. An occupied window stays open for that shift." },
